  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that rna_only models with multiprofile, scvi_n200 encoder, and avgpool aggregation (config_005/006) achieve high accuracy (0.65+). This experiment tests whether adding image data (resnet50) to this strong RNA-only baseline improves performance, isolating the effect of multimodal fusion. It directly addresses whether combining RNA and image data can yield better results than the current top-performing RNA-only model, while keeping other parameters consistent to focus on the multimodal component's impact."
}

